    "thought": "The Artemis overview page already states that Artemis III is a demonstration mission in low Earth orbit planned for 2027 with a description that clearly gives its purpose, so I can directly report the required mission name, launch year, destination, and primary objective and end the task per the stopping condition.",
    "termination_review": {
